---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Remove a reference (or --verify obligation) from an entity

Usage: specforge unlink [OPTIONS] <ENTITY> [FIELD] [TARGET]

Arguments:
  <ENTITY>
          The entity to change

  [FIELD]
          The list field

  [TARGET]
          The entity id (or text, for a string list) to add or remove

Options:
      --verify <KIND:TEXT>
          A `verify` obligation: `kind:text` when the kind is one of the entity's verify kinds, else the whole text

      --dry-run
          Print the diff and write nothing

      --revision <REVISION>
          The revision of the entity's file (`sha256:<digest>`, as `specforge.inspect` answers it): refused with `stale_revision` when the file has changed since

      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
